(text "PCB B: analog filters ONLY. J32 -> external J2 A0-A3/GND; J33 -> external J13 A0/A1/GND.\nJ2 ADDR=GND (0x48); J13 ADDR=VDD (0x49), A2/A3=GND; both ALRT NC. C6/C10 at modules.\nADCs powered from A, NOT B. J25: GND/3V3_SENS from C. No SDA/SCL on B. Verify sensor model." (at 15 23 0) (effects (font (size 1.1 1.1)) (justify left)) (uuid 7bdfdde6-40a5-549b-9d5d-828a120eb312))
